<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jabil Circuit started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jabil Circuit started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said it initiated coverage of Jabil Circuit Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said set a near-term price target of $42-$45</p>
<p>-- set 1997 earnings estimate of $1.94 a share and 1998 earnings estimate of $2.37 a share.</p>
<p>-- Jabil gained 1-3/8 to 40.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
